OL,3,GNEWSAForce hopes 'game-changing'
OL,4,Atactics will turn shoplifting tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew tactics rolled out this year by
OL,7,FMerseyside Police mean that when there
OL,8,Fis overwhelming evidence against a
OL,9,Fshoplifting suspect, a fast-track
OL,10,Fdigital evidence-gathering protocol can
OL,11,Fbe followed to free up officers to
OL,12,Finvestigate more cases.
OL,14,FCh Insp Chris Ruane said the results of
OL,15,FOperation Dale were "game changing" and
OL,16,Fthat his force was now solving about
OL,17,F46% of reported offences -
OL,18,Fapproximately double the rate of six
OL,19,Fmonths ago.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
