OL,3,GNEWSAForce hopes 'game-changing'
OL,4,Atactics will turn shoplifting tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city-centre neighbourhood team's
OL,7,Fworkload is increasing, too, with the
OL,8,Fnumber of reported incidents having
OL,9,Fincreased by about 10% during the last
OL,10,Ffinancial year.
OL,12,FRuane acknowledges: "It is a challenge
OL,13,Ffor us but we have a dedicated policing
OL,14,Fteam who are combating those offences."
